# layer-conforms-to reads the validator under test, the helper the validator loads beside itself
# (fail-open: absent draws only a W11 warning, so it is REQUIRED and consumed by a presence-guarded
# sentinel), the shipping layer contract that seed.sh copies into every seeded consumer, and the
# shared fixture preamble. Its own directory is copied by the runner without being named.
!core/scripts/validate-layer-entries.sh
!core/scripts/artifact-path-config.sh
core/skills/ai-dlc/layer-contract.yaml
core/fixtures/lib/
